<title>USA: Ohio $162 mln agency deal repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Ohio $162 mln agency deal repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Son said Tuesday it repriced Ohio Building Authority's $162 million bond deal, lowering yields in some maturities but leaving the top yield in 2011 at 5.50 percent.</p>
